Z||000000||KRMFiero||01-28-2001||08:44 AM||||Okay, Me and my friend are going to be doing a race, he wants to build a go-kart to build,  I will be racing with a lawnmower.  right now I have a Craftsmen ridding lawnmower without the engine. I am thinking about getting rid of the Transaxle and replacing with a live axle/horizontal engine set up. but i am not sure... maybe even two engines.   would like a 1970's snowmobile engine work good? (might be able to find one at junkyard)<BR>ANY SUGGESTIONS?<P>but my friend  he doesnt even have a frame yet, he want to build his own. anyone have any plans for a frame, we found a old snowblower 2 stroke engine (small but rev's high) and he wants to use that.<BR>ANY SUGGESTIONS?<P>I will post pictures of progress if you guys want<P>------------------<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2M4 SE<P>  <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/~Physcokyle/fiero.jpg"> ||||reg||1
